; EDITOR MAIN LOOP (command mode and INPUT)
; Key codes (KEYGET, from the key-code table KYCDTB in bank 6 at 94FBH):
;   01 SHIFT  02 SML  03 CTRL  04 KBII  05 BS  08 <-  09 rocker  0A down  0B up
;   0C ->  0D ENTER  0E ON/BREAK  0F OFF  11-16 F1-F6  18 CL  19 RCL  1B DEF
;   1F MODE; 20H-FFH characters.
; SHIFT, CTRL and DEF only toggle modifier state (EDMODKEY).  The key is then
; dispatched through inline tables (S7467): editing keys, CTRL combinations,
; EDKEYTAB for the control codes 08H-0FH/18H-1FH, F1-F6 (RESERVE keys), shortcut
